    '**The setting (5 minutes).** The question about greatness (18:1); the word about a brother (18:15–17); Peter’s question (18:21); Jesus’ answer (18:22); “Therefore” (18:23); the Kingdom ministry of Matthew 4:17 and 10:5–7.',
    '**The first servant in sequence (6 minutes).** A reckoning, ten thousand talents, not to pay, the command to sell, the plea, the compassion, the release. What the text says and does not say.',
    '**The fellowservant in sequence (6 minutes).** An hundred pence, the hands on the throat, the same plea, “he would not,” the prison. What the text says and does not say.',
